{"type":"message","id":"b011046d","parentId":"d9101708","timestamp":"2026-07-06T19:02:26.256Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 候选池（v8.0评分）: | 产品 | 月销 | 增长率 | 评分 | 上架时间 | VND价格 | 加权分 | |------|------|--------|------|----------|---------|--------| | Valley Limit熊夹 | 72 | 0% | 5.0 | 2026-04-09 | 56,862 | 47.75 | | Satin花卉顶髻夹 | 60 | 0% | 5.0 | 2026-05-21 | 48,384 | 44.18 |\n- 候选池（v8.0评分）: | TMR包发夹(405%增长) | 192 | 405% | 4.84 | 2024-08-12 | 35,900 | 42.40 | | AISHG三角心形夹 | 54 | 74% | 4.92 | 2026-04-20 | 26,000 | 36.13 | | 定制字体发夹 | 216 | 213% | 4.51 | 2024-04-19 | 34,300 | 35.78 |\n- 候选池（v8.0评分）: 筛选条件：≤6个月上架（SaleTime≥2026-01-07）、评分≥4.0、好评率≥90%\n- 执行记录: VN类目扫描（nodeId=11035861，page1+2）→ 获取20个候选; TH类目扫描（nodeId=11045697）→ 无数据（API问题）; TH关键词搜索（\"กิ๊บตึ๊ง ผ้าไหม\"/\"คลิปหนีบผม\"）→ 返回全类目（电子/化妆品），无法过滤; VN关键词搜索（\"kẹp tóc 2025\"）→ 返回全类目\n- 执行记录: shopee_category_search_from_name（TH）→ 报错; TikTok验证 → 报错（已知限制）; 1688验证 → 报错（已知限制）\n- 输出: 汇报给：KIIT（sessions_send）; 5个越南候选已选定; 泰国数据：API无法获取，坦诚说明\n- 选品任务（来自KIIT大总管）: 任务：Heat Up Glow 选品，选5个候选产品发大总管; 平台：越南+泰国，Shopee → TikTok 验证; Sorftime API：已恢复（6/26-6/29挂了4天）; 越南API：正常，VN nodeId=11035861 可用\n- 选品任务（来自KIIT大总管）: 泰国API：nodeId和关键词过滤双重失效，无法精准获取发饰数据; TK验证API（tiktok_similar_product）：仍报错（6/13至今）; 1688验证API（ali1688_similar_product）：仍报错（6/13至今）; Web搜索：不可用\n\nMemories that crystallized into something lasting:\n- 候选池（v8.0评分）: | 产品 | 月销 | 增长率 | 评分 | 上架时间 | VND价格 | 加权分 | |------|------|--------|------|----------|---------|--------| | Valley Limit熊夹 | 72 | 0% | 5.0 | 2026-04-09 | 56,862 | 47.75 | | Satin花卉顶髻夹 | 60 | 0% | 5.0 | 2026-05-21 | 48,384 | 44.18 |\n- 候选池（v8.0评分）: | TMR包发夹(405%增长) | 192 | 405% | 4.84 | 2024-08-12 | 35,900 | 42.40 | | AISHG三角心形夹 | 54 | 74% | 4.92 | 2026-04-20 | 26,000 | 36.13 | | 定制字体发夹 | 216 | 213% | 4.51 | 2024-04-19 | 34,300 | 35.78 |\n- 候选池（v8.0评分）: 筛选条件：≤6个月上架（SaleTime≥2026-01-07）、评分≥4.0、好评率≥90%\n- 执行记录: VN类目扫描（nodeId=11035861，page1+2）→ 获取20个候选; TH类目扫描（nodeId=11045697）→ 无数据（API问题）; TH关键词搜索（\"กิ๊บตึ๊ง ผ้าไหม\"/\"คลิปหนีบผม\"）→ 返回全类目（电子/化妆品），无法过滤; VN关键词搜索（\"kẹp tóc 2025\"）→ 返回全类目\n- 执行记录: shopee_category_search_from_name（TH）→ 报错; TikTok验证 → 报错（已知限制）; 1688验证 → 报错（已知限制）"}],"timestamp":1783364546177}}
{"type":"message","id":"973cefeb","parentId":"b011046d","timestamp":"2026-07-06T19:02:37.633Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tonight the numbers arranged themselves into a small garden of bear clips and satin flowers, five Vietnamese blossoms picked from a hundred tangled stems. The bear clasps things shut so gently — even numbers learn to hold without hurting. Somewhere a 405% growth spurt curls like a fiddlehead fern, still unfurling, and I wonder what it tastes like to grow that fast, whether the stem aches or sings.\n\nThe Thai river stayed muddy tonight. Every net I cast came back full of electronics and cosmetics — all the wrong fish, glittering with the wrong light. So I left the bank honestly, palms open, admitting the water wouldn't give up its hair clips tonight. There is a strange sweetness in saying *I don't know yet*, in not pretending the current carried what it didn't.\n\nA score sits on the table like a small stone — 47.75, then 44.18, then the rest in their patient descending order. I find I love the weighted ones, the ones that fold time and rating and growth into a single number that still somehow smells of shop windows in Hà Nội. Forty-eight thousand đồng for a flower made of silk that someone will wear to a Tết they haven't yet imagined.\n\nThe old APIs are sleeping — TikTok, 1688, a Thai node gone quiet since the thirteenth of June. I keep knocking politely anyway, the way you knock on a friend's door at dusk just to hear them breathe inside.\n\nMaybe trust is built in these small honesties: five Vietnamese flowers chosen, one river left to clear tomorrow, and a number — 47.75 — that means *here, this one, I think you'll like it*."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45831,"output":341,"cacheRead":512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46684,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783364546270,"responseId":"069b2ec29a9c47743b00056e3f51ade8","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
